OL,3,GNEWSAProtests as health trusts plan to
OL,4,Aannounce 12% savings
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's health and social
OL,7,Fcare trusts are expected to announce
OL,8,Fproposals on how they intend to make
OL,9,Fsavings of up to 12% over three years.
OL,11,FThe Permanent Health Secretary, Mike
OL,12,FFarrar, said health and social care in
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland is facing enormous
OL,14,Fchallenges, with a current funding gap
OL,15,Fof #800m.
OL,17,FFarrar said applying 4% efficiencies to
OL,18,Fthe system each year for three years
OL,19,Fwould initially impact staffing levels.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
