OL,3,GNEWSAProtests as health trusts plan to
OL,4,Aannounce 12% savings
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth unions have told BBC News NI
OL,7,Fthey understand jobs will be affected
OL,8,Fas the trusts attempt to make the
OL,9,Fsavings. Those posts could include
OL,10,Fporter and cleaning posts. Unions been
OL,11,Fholding protests at a number of
OL,12,Fhospital sites.
